1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:04,103
...at the time of your birth
somehow affects your personality.

2
00:00:06,443 --> 00:00:08,073
(Penny:)Participate in the what?

3
00:00:08,237 --> 00:00:10,067
(Leonard:)I think what Sheldon's trying to say...

4
00:00:10,239 --> 00:00:12,989
(Leonard:)...is that Sagittarius wouldn't have been
our first guess.

5
00:00:13,158 --> 00:00:15,828
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, a lot of people
think I'm a water sign.

6
00:00:16,579 --> 00:00:18,369
(Penny:)Okay, let's see, what else?

7
00:00:18,539 --> 00:00:19,579
(Penny:)Oh, I'm a vegetarian.

8
00:00:19,748 --> 00:00:23,798
No, except for fish,
and the occasional steak. I love steak.

9
00:00:25,337 --> 00:00:26,837
Well, that's interesting.

10
00:00:27,006 --> 00:00:28,586
(Sheldon:)Leonard can't process corn.

11
00:00:33,429 --> 00:00:35,009
So do you have some sort of a job?

12
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,220
PENNY:
Oh, yeah.

13
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,390
(Penny:)I'm a waitress
at The Cheesecake Factory.

14
00:00:39,101 --> 00:00:40,351
(Leonard:)I love cheesecake.

15
00:00:40,519 --> 00:00:43,899
- You're lactose intolerant.
- I don't eat it, I think it's a good idea.

16
00:00:45,482 --> 00:00:47,322
(Penny:)Anyways, I'm also writing a screenplay.

17
00:00:47,484 --> 00:00:50,904
(Penny:)It's about this sensitive girl who comes
to L.A. from Lincoln, Nebraska...

18
00:00:51,071 --> 00:00:55,281
(Penny:)...to be an actress and winds up
a waitress at The Cheesecake Factory.

19
00:00:55,868 --> 00:00:57,578
(Leonard:)So it's based on your life.

20
00:00:57,745 --> 00:01:03,025
(Penny:)No, I'm from Omaha.

